## Window switching / navigation
#
 A+Tab = Next window
 W+7   = Pin window  (always on top)
 W+8   = Minimize window (iconify)
 W+9   = Center window at w=70% h=80%
 W+0   = Maximize window
 
 C+W+Up    = move window up at 50% of screen 
 C+W+Down  = move window down at 50% of screen
 C+W+Left  = move window left at 50% of screen
 C+W+Right = move window right at 50% of screen
 
 W+Up    = shrink window vertically up
 W+Down  = shrink window vertically down
 W+Left  = shrink window horizontally left
 W+Right = shrink window horizontally right


## Desktop switching
#
 W+1 = GoToDesktop 1
 W+2 = GoToDesktop 2
 W-3 = GoToDesktop 3
 
 S+W+1 = SendToDesktop 1
 S+W+2 = SendToDesktop 2 
 S+W+3 = SendToDesktop 3

 W-d = ToggleShowDesktop  #mostra desk, abaixa/sobe todas janelas


## General Shortcuts (defined by SXHKD)
#
 W+Enter = Terminal (kitty)
 W+m     = Text Editor (Emacs GUI)
 W+n     = Text Editor (Neo Vim)
 W+w     = Web Browser (Brave)
 W+f	 = File Manager (pcmanfm)
 W+v     = PulseAudio Mixer (pulsemixer)
 
 w+PrintScreen   = Take Screenshot (flameshot)

 W+Space = WM menu (root-menu)
 W+Space = WM menu (root-menu)
 C+Space = Window menu (client-menu)
 W+r     = Run  (Drun)
 A-Space = Switch keyboard layout (us,br) [uses gxkb]

 A+Escape  = Lower  #MovePraTraz janelas ativas, focando na proxima (ciclicamente) 
 C+W+r	   = Resize window (n funciona na tela maximizada)
 C+W+m 	   = Move window (n funciona na tela maximizada)
 A+F4      = Close
  
 W+C+Left  = Move window to left (50% size) 
 W+C+Right = Move window to right (50% size) 
 W+C+Up    = Move window Up (50% size) 
 W+C+Down  = Move window Down (50% size)

 C+W+A+r = Reconfigure openbox  (reload configs)

 	 S+W+q = Oblogout  (log off openbox)